WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.937
Here are the program's rules, from Book 17,
each held as a finding with a stable ID.

2
00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:09.525
Creation is closed, so an
agent can't just appear.

3
00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:13.429
Every production agent has a
reviewed handshake before it exists,

4
00:00:13.429 --> 00:00:15.913
naming who answers for
it and what it may do.

5
00:00:15.913 --> 00:00:20.399
Credentials prefer a managed identity,
and never a production secret.

6
00:00:20.399 --> 00:00:24.279
Inheritance never hands every
future grant to every agent,

7
00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:27.288
and no agent holds a
standing privileged role.

8
00:00:27.288 --> 00:00:32.600
Sponsors are real employees, and a transfer
has ten business days to be confirmed.

9
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.350
And drift is watched, with priorities.
